rut, Lebanon.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Leblanc E\",\"firstName\":\"Eric\",\"lastName\":\"Leblanc\",\"initials\":\"E\",\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"Univ.Lille, Inserm, CHU Lille, U-1192 - Laboratoire Protéomique Réponse Inflammatoire Spectrométrie de Masse - PRISM, F-59000, Lille, France. e-leblanc@o-lambret.fr.\"},{\"affiliation\":\"Department of Gynecology Oncology, Oscar Lambret Cancer Center, 59020, Lille, France. e-leblanc@o-lambret.fr.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Fournier I\",\"firstName\":\"Isabelle\",\"lastName\":\"Fournier\",\"initials\":\"I\",\"authorId\":{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-1096-5044\"},\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"Univ.Lille, Inserm, CHU Lille, U-1192 - Laboratoire Protéomique Réponse Inflammatoire Spectrométrie de Masse - PRISM, F-59000, Lille, France. isabelle.fournier@univ-lille.fr.\"},{\"affiliation\":\"Institut Universitaire de France, 75000, Paris, France. isabelle.fournier@univ-lille.fr.\"}]}},{\"fullName\":\"Salzet M\",\"firstName\":\"Michel\",\"lastName\":\"Salzet\",\"initials\":\"M\",\"authorId\":{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-4318-0817\"},\"authorAffiliationDetailsList\":{\"authorAffiliation\":[{\"affiliation\":\"Univ.Lille, Inserm, CHU Lille, U-1192 - Laboratoire Protéomique Réponse Inflammatoire Spectrométrie de Masse - PRISM, F-59000, Lille, France. michel.salzet@univ-lille.fr.\"},{\"affiliation\":\"Institut Universitaire de France, 75000, Paris, France. michel.salzet@univ-lille.fr.\"}]}}]},\"authorIdList\":{\"authorId\":[{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-2045-4785\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-4006-5605\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-5008-6944\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0002-8500-2309\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-1096-5044\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-1320-075X\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-1751-0528\"},{\"type\":\"ORCID\",\"value\":\"0000-0003-4318-0817\"}]},\"dataLinksTagsList\":{\"dataLinkstag\":[\"altmetrics\",\"supporting_data\",\"full_text\",\"related_data\"]},\"journalInfo\":{\"issue\":\"9\",\"volume\":\"14\",\"journalIssueId\":3625444,\"dateOfPublication\":\"2023 Sep\",\"monthOfPublication\":9,\"yearOfPublication\":2023,\"printPublicationDate\":\"2023-09-01\",\"journal\":{\"title\":\"Cell death & disease\",\"medlineAbbreviation\":\"Cell Death Dis\",\"isoabbreviation\":\"Cell Death Dis\",\"nlmid\":\"101524092\",\"essn\":\"2041-4889\",\"issn\":\"2041-4889\"}},\"pubYear\":\"2023\",\"pageInfo\":\"644\",\"abstractText\":\"Ovarian cancer is the leading cause of death from gynecologic cancer worldwide. High-grade serous carcinoma (HGSC) is the most common and deadliest subtype of ovarian cancer. While the origin of ovarian tumors is still debated, it has been suggested that HGSC originates from cells in the fallopian tube epithelium (FTE), specifically the epithelial cells in the region of the tubal-peritoneal junction. Three main lesions, p53 signatures, STILs, and STICs, have been defined based on the immunohistochemistry (IHC) pattern of p53 and Ki67 markers and the architectural alterations of the cells, using the Sectioning and Extensively Examining the Fimbriated End Protocol. In this study, we performed an in-depth proteomic analysis of these pre-neoplastic epithelial lesions guided by mass spectrometry imaging and IHC. We evaluated specific markers related to each preneoplastic lesion. The study identified specific lesion markers, such as CAVIN1, Emilin2, and FBLN5. We also used SpiderMass technology to perform a lipidomic analysis and identified the specific presence of specific lipids signature including dietary Fatty acids precursors in lesions. Our study provides new insights into the molecular mechanisms underlying the progression of ovarian cancer and confirms the fimbria origin of HGSC.\",\"affiliation\":\"Univ.Lille, Inserm, CHU Lille, U-1192 - Laboratoire Protéomique Réponse Inflammatoire Spectrométrie de Masse - PRISM, F-59000, Lille, France.\",\"publicationStatus\":\"epublish\",\"language\":\"eng\",\"pubModel\":\"Electronic\",\"pubTypeList\":{\"pubType\":[\"Research Support, Non-U.S. Gov't\",\"research-article\",\"Journal Article\"]},\"meshHeadingList\":{\"meshHeading\":[{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Fallopian Tubes\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Humans\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"descriptorName\":\"Cystadenocarcinoma, Serous\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"abbreviation\":\"GE\",\"qualifierName\":\"genetics\",\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"PA\",\"qualifierName\":\"pathology\",\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"descriptorName\":\"Ovarian Neoplasms\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"abbreviation\":\"GE\",\"qualifierName\":\"genetics\",\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"PA\",\"qualifierName\":\"pathology\",\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"Y\",\"descriptorName\":\"Fallopian Tube Neoplasms\",\"meshQualifierList\":{\"meshQualifier\":[{\"abbreviation\":\"GE\",\"qualifierName\":\"genetics\",\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"PA\",\"qualifierName\":\"pathology\",\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\"},{\"abbreviation\":\"CH\",\"qualifierName\":\"chemistry\",\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\"}]}},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Proteomics\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Female\"},{\"majorTopic_YN\":\"N\",\"descriptorName\":\"Tumor Suppressor Protein p53\"}]},\"chemicalList\":{\"chemical\":[{\"name\":\"Tumor Suppressor Protein p53\",\"registryNumber\":\"0\"}]},\"subsetList\":{\"subset\":[{\"code\":\"IM\",\"name\":\"Index Medicus\"}]},\"fullTextUrlList\":{\"fullTextUrl\":[{\"availability\":\"Open access\",\"availabilityCode\":\"OA\",\"documentStyle\":\"pdf\",\"site\":\"Unpaywall\",\"url\":\"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41419-023-06165-5.pdf\"},{\"availability\":\"Subscription required\",\"availabilityCode\":\"S\",\"documentStyle\":\"doi\",\"site\":\"DOI\",\"url\":\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41419-023-06165-5\"},{\"availability\":\"Open access\",\"availabilityCode\":\"OA\",\"documentStyle\":\"html\",\"site\":\"Europe_PMC\",\"url\":\"https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC10541450\"},{\"availability\":\"Open access\",\"availabilityCode\":\"OA\",\"documentStyle\":\"pdf\",\"site\":\"Europe_PMC\",\"url\":\"https://europepmc.org/articles/PMC10541450?pdf=render\"}]},\"commentCorrectionList\":{\"commentCorrection\":[{\"id\":\"PPR674694\",\"source\":\"PPR\",\"type\":\"Preprint in\",\"note\":\"CrossRef Pre-print loader\",\"orderIn\":10002}]},\"isOpenAccess\":\"Y\",\"inEPMC\":\"Y\",\"inPMC\":\"Y\",\"hasPDF\":\"Y\",\"hasBook\":\"N\",\"hasSuppl\":\"Y\",\"citedByCount\":16,\"hasData\":\"Y\",\"hasReferences\":\"Y\",\"hasTextMinedTerms\":\"Y\",\"hasDbCrossReferences\":\"Y\",\"dbCrossReferenceList\":{\"dbName\":[\"PRIDE\"]},\"hasLabsLinks\":\"Y\",\"license\":\"cc by\",\"hasEvaluations\":\"N\",\"authMan\":\"N\",\"epmcAuthMan\":\"N\",\"nihAuthMan\":\"N\",\"hasTMAccessionNumbers\":\"Y\",\"tmAccessionTypeList\":{\"accessionType\":[\"nct\"]},\"dateOfCompletion\":\"2023-10-05\",\"dateOfCreation\":\"2023-09-29\",\"firstIndexDate\":\"2023-10-01\",\"fullTextReceivedDate\":\"2025-02-04\",\"dateOfRevision\":\"2023-10-05\",\"electronicPublicationDate\":\"2023-09-30\",\"firstPublicationDate\":\"2023-09-30\"}]}}","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
